# Motion study of several parameters, and as one glTF animation (F9
# Mechanisms): the box and its driven lid, a second parameter added;
# Assembly > Motion Study drives angle from 0 to 110 and the other with
# it in two steps, listing both; the other taken out, the study saved as
# lid.glb lists the one file once, on its first step.
file $testdata/ui/mechanism/boxlid.tlspr
menu File|Open...
menu Edit|Parameters...
click-tw [add a parameter]
edit gap = 2
menu Assembly|Motion Study...
tw
click-tw [drive another parameter with it]
click-tw #3 [change]
edit 110
click-tw #7 [change]
edit 2
click-tw [run]
tw
click-tw #2 [remove]
file $tmp/lid.glb
click-tw [run, saving each step...]
tw
